---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section class="hero" id="about"><div class="copy"><span class="caption">● &nbsp; HI, FROM FAGE’S DESK</span><h1 aria-label="嗨，我是发哥。"><span class="headline-visual" aria-hidden="true">嗨，我是发哥。</span></h1><p class="intro-line">做过一些有用的东西，也做过一些纯粹好玩的。都在桌上，随便翻。</p></div>
<div class="actor"><div class="speech" id="speech" role="status" aria-live="polite">来啦？桌上随便翻。</div><button class="person" aria-label="戳一下发哥，查看下一种反应" id="person"><img class="avatar" id="avatar" alt="" src={`${base}assets/fage-welcome.webp`}></button><div class="mini-launch" aria-label="小游戏与小工具"><button type="button" data-mini-open="dice" aria-label="比骰子" title="比骰子"><img src={`${base}assets/mini-dice.webp`} width="44" height="44" alt="" draggable="false"></button><button type="button" data-mini-open="rps" aria-label="石头剪刀布" title="石头剪刀布"><img src={`${base}assets/mini-rps.webp`} width="44" height="44" alt="" draggable="false"></button><a class="mini-tool" href={`${base}tools/xiao-liu-ren/`} aria-label="掐指一算" title="掐指一算"><img src={`${base}assets/liuren-hand.svg`} width="44" height="44" alt="" draggable="false"></a></div></div><div class="hero-wechat"><img class="wechat-qr" src={`${base}assets/wechat-qr.jpg`} width="430" height="430" alt="发哥聊一聊AI 微信公众号二维码"><div><strong>微信搜索 「发哥聊一聊AI」</strong></div></div></section>